Keep the UTF-8 byte-string boundary explicit when C++20 filesystem APIs
return std::u8string. Share a private helper for file opening, menu labels and
recent-file JSON, which must stay a string rather than an array of code units.

--- a/bin/tlplay/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/bin/tlplay/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@
     FilesModel.h
     MainWindow.h
